Zaretto FlightGear aircraft (fg-aircraft)

Licensed under the GNU General Public License, version 2 only. See COPYING.
Files with their own licence header are licensed as stated in that header.

The F-14 and F-15 are submodules with their own COPYING and AUTHORS files; see
f-14b/AUTHORS and F-15/AUTHORS for the contributors to each aircraft.

Richard Harrison <rjh@zaretto.com>
    Maintainer. Development-Items: source artwork, textures, 3D model sources,
    sounds, Emesary development, input configurations, simulator screenshots
    and work in progress.

Vivian Meazza
    Development-Items/emesary/nimitz.xml and eisenhower.xml (carrier scenarios).

Development-Items/F-14 and Development-Items/F-15 hold source material for the
aircraft, which includes work derived from the contributors listed in the
AUTHORS file of each aircraft.

Development-Items/Sounds: most of the sounds are recorded and built by Richard
Harrison from individual engine and airframe components. links.txt and
engine-noises-links.txt are reference notes, not sources of the audio.

